# Model using only the House Data 
# (1) Linear Regression full model 

Mean Cross-Validation Score: This is the average accuracy of the model across different subsets of the training data. Here, it's about 47.41%.

Train Score: This measures how well the model fits the training data, about 48.12%.

Test Score: This evaluates the model's performance on new, unseen data. It's about 45.28%.

Overall, the model's performance is modest, explaining around 48.12% of the training data and 45.28% of the test data.

# (2) Lasso Rergession 
